<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="556949927"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:37.973"><div begin="29.183" end="1:00.596" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.183" end="36.384" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.183" end="30.666">听着自</span><span begin="30.666" end="31.183">己</span><span begin="31.183" end="31.448">的</span><span begin="31.448" end="31.983">心</span><span begin="31.983" end="32.634">跳</span> <span begin="33.075" end="34.483">没有规</span><span begin="34.483" end="35.051">则</span><span begin="35.051" end="35.374">地</span><span begin="35.374" end="36.384">跳跃</span></p><p begin="36.884" end="44.231" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.884" end="38.263">我安静</span><span begin="38.263" end="40.342">地在思考</span> <span begin="40.686" end="42.099">并不想</span><span begin="42.099" end="43.597">被谁打</span><span begin="43.597" end="44.231">扰</span></p><p begin="44.537" end="51.556" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.537" end="44.956">我</span><span begin="44.956" end="46.756">们曾紧紧</span><span begin="46.756" end="47.207">拥</span><span begin="47.207" end="47.850">抱</span> <span begin="48.281" end="49.705">却又轻</span><span begin="49.705" end="50.225">易</span><span begin="50.225" end="50.468">地</span><span begin="50.468" end="51.556">放掉</span></p><p begin="52.060" end="1:00.596" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.060" end="54.947">那种感觉很微</span><span begin="54.947" end="55.572">妙</span><span begin="55.859" end="57.275"> 该怎么</span><span begin="57.275" end="58.259">说</span><span begin="58.259" end="58.787">才</span><span begin="58.787" end="1:00.596">好</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.438" end="1:13.090" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:01.438" end="1:05.046" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.438" end="1:03.030">时间分</span><span begin="1:03.030" end="1:04.480">割成对</span><span begin="1:04.480" end="1:05.046">角</span></p><p begin="1:05.463" end="1:13.090" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.463" end="1:06.871">停止你</span><span begin="1:06.871" end="1:08.322">对我的</span><span begin="1:08.322" end="1:08.986">好 </span><span begin="1:09.223" end="1:10.605">瓦解我</span><span begin="1:10.605" end="1:12.005">们的依</span><span begin="1:12.005" end="1:13.090">靠</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.411" end="1:47.566" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:13.411" end="1:20.819" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.411" end="1:15.387">在你离开</span><span begin="1:15.387" end="1:16.137">之后</span><span begin="1:16.137" end="1:16.403">的</span><span begin="1:16.403" end="1:16.819">天</span><span begin="1:16.819" end="1:17.416">空 </span><span begin="1:17.721" end="1:18.270">我像</span><span begin="1:18.270" end="1:19.219">风筝</span><span begin="1:19.219" end="1:19.921">寻一</span><span begin="1:19.921" end="1:20.219">个</span><span begin="1:20.219" end="1:20.819">梦</span></p><p begin="1:21.085" end="1:29.413" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.085" end="1:22.013">雨后</span><span begin="1:22.013" end="1:22.978">的</span><span begin="1:22.978" end="1:23.511">天</span><span begin="1:23.511" end="1:24.618">空</span><span begin="1:24.877" end="1:25.877"> 是否</span><span begin="1:25.877" end="1:26.776">有</span><span begin="1:26.776" end="1:27.576">放晴</span><span begin="1:27.576" end="1:28.176">后</span><span begin="1:28.176" end="1:28.488">的</span><span begin="1:28.488" end="1:29.413">面容</span></p><p begin="1:29.466" end="1:36.447" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.466" end="1:29.629">我</span><span begin="1:29.629" end="1:30.580">静静</span><span begin="1:30.580" end="1:31.564">地望</span><span begin="1:31.564" end="1:31.863">着</span><span begin="1:31.863" end="1:32.380">天</span><span begin="1:32.380" end="1:32.866">空</span> <span begin="1:33.018" end="1:33.482">试着</span><span begin="1:33.482" end="1:34.423">寻找</span><span begin="1:34.423" end="1:35.323">失落的</span><span begin="1:35.323" end="1:36.447">感动</span></p><p begin="1:36.794" end="1:47.566" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent